  "AppWindow Presenters": "AppWindow 呈现器（Presenters）",
  "OverlappedPresenter is the default presenter for AppWindow, providing a standard resizable window with system buttons. It is used for typical app windows and can be customized to control resizing and button visibility.": "OverlappedPresenter 是 AppWindow 的默认呈现器，可创建带系统按钮、可调整大小的标准窗口。它适用于常见应用窗口，也可自定义窗口缩放和按钮的显示状态。",
  "Keeps the window above all other windows when enabled.": "启用后，此窗口会始终显示在其他窗口上方。",
  "Controls the visibility and enable state of the maximize button.": "控制最大化按钮是否显示以及是否可用。",
  "Controls the visibility and enable state of the minimize button.": "控制最小化按钮是否显示以及是否可用。",
  "Allows resizing the window by dragging its edges.": "允许拖动窗口边缘来调整大小。",
  "Determines if the window has a visible outer border.": "设置窗口是否显示外边框。",
  "Specifies whether the window includes a system title bar.": "设置窗口是否包含系统标题栏。",
  "The minimum and maximum width and height can be set on an AppWindow. When setting the maximum width or height, it's recommended to disable the window maximization.": "AppWindow 可以设置最小和最大宽高。设置最大宽度或高度时，建议同时禁用窗口最大化。",
  "A modal window is a separate window that blocks interaction with its owner window until it is closed, often used for critical actions like confirmations, authentication, or settings. Unlike a ContentDialog, which is a lightweight pop-up within the same window, a modal window is a fully independent window, making it suitable for multi-window applications or scenarios requiring more flexibility in layout and behavior.": "模态窗口是一个独立窗口。在它关闭之前，用户不能操作其所属窗口，常用于确认、身份验证或设置等重要流程。ContentDialog 则是在同一窗口中显示的轻量弹出界面。模态窗口适合多窗口应用，或需要更灵活布局和行为的场景。",
  "The FullScreenPresenter makes an AppWindow cover the entire screen, removing the title bar and system UI to create an immersive experience. To ensure usability, an exit mechanism, such as handling the Escape key or close button, should be included, and fullscreen mode should be used in scenarios like media playback or focused tasks.": "FullScreenPresenter 会让 AppWindow 覆盖整个屏幕，并隐藏标题栏和系统界面，带来沉浸式体验。为保证易用性，应提供退出方式，例如处理 Escape 键或显示关闭按钮。全屏模式适合媒体播放或需要专注的任务。",
  "Show window (Fullscreen mode)": "显示窗口（全屏模式）",
  "CompactOverlayPresenter (Picture-in-Picture mode) keeps an AppWindow always on top while using minimal screen space. To ensure a good user experience, the window should have a small yet functional size (e.g., for media players or floating tools).": "CompactOverlayPresenter（画中画模式）会让 AppWindow 始终置顶，同时尽量减少占用的屏幕空间。窗口应保持小巧且仍可正常操作，适合媒体播放器或悬浮工具等场景。",
  "Show window (Picture-in-Picture mode)": "显示窗口（画中画模式）",
  "Small: Window size is approximately 5% of the display's work area.": "小：窗口大小约占显示器工作区域的 5%。",
